## Migration Awareness

If module has migration scripts:
```
INFO: MIGRATION_CHAIN_PRESENT
  Module: <module>
  Version: <from> → <to>
```

For DB migrations, always use:
```bash
make update m=<module>
```
Never alter version logic or migration scripts without explicit instruction.

